  "bodyHash": "4TulIrrJR6Y=",
  "content": "这是为[Create Ore Excavation](https://github.com/mikeee1/create_ore_excavation_plus)模组开发的子模组，旨在提高通过钻机获取钻石和绿宝石的难度。之所以这样做，是因为原版机制过于强力。\n\n将原始绿宝石和钻石转化为常规宝石的流程如下：\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1. 将原始钻石与50mB混合，得到加热的原始钻石或钻石粉尘<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AhMH6Zj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"428\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1.5 使用16份钻石粉尘可重新获得原始钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S867Pxk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"432\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">2. 清洗加热的原始钻石获得洗净的原始钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sWLxlgs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"306\"><br>3. 切割洗净的原始钻石获得切割原始钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ph4bGBt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"311\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">4. 压制切割原始钻石获得压制原始钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZIZ7wb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"742\" height=\"312\"><br>5. 抛光压制原始钻石最终获得钻石<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jHWph32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"255\"></span></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n红石的转化流程也略有调整：\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>1. 粉碎原始红石</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ssdJpbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"433\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. 向粉碎后的红石注入100mB水</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/meSCZLe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"312\"></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">下界合金的加工方式较为特殊：<br></span>\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1. 钻取原始下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hvros7o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"422\"><br>2. 熔烧原始下界合金碎片获得灼烧过的合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ezb6xBY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"310\"><br>3. 对灼烧碎片进行灵淬获得灵淬原始合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KEuPGLS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"310\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">4. 烟熏灵淬原始合金碎片获得煅烧合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mc7MeLo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"311\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">5. 将煅烧合金碎片与熔岩混合获得熔岩淬火合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOZ6Pf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"430\"><br>6. 泼洒熔岩淬火合金碎片最终获得下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XYm7Crz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"307\"></span></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">新增通过压制下界合金碎片与金锭合成下界合金锭的功能。<br><br>开采下界合金需使用终极钻机，制作方式如下：<br></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4oeDLq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"445\"></p></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">现在还可以使用流体提取器在主世界和下界采集熔岩。</span>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
